        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Femstat cats get kidnapped, then release",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "A statement to the press, let the rest know who did that",
