        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Cell number 17, up under the top bunk",
          "rhyme": "9nk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I say this not to be mean, wish bad luck or pop junk",
          "rhyme": "9nk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Pop the trunk on C-Cipher Punk, leave him left scraped",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "God forbid, if ain’t no escape, blame MF tape",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Definition: “Supervillain,” a killer who love children",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "One who is well-skilled in destruction as well as building",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "While Sidney Sheldon teaches the trife to be trifer",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I’m trading science fiction with my man, the live lifer",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "A pied piper holler a rhyme, a dollar and a dime",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Do his thing, ring around the white collar crime.  Get out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "My face, asking ‘bout my case.  You need toothpaste",
          "rhyme": "ast",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Refresher mint, monkey-style nigga the Dentadent",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And dope fiends still in their teens, shook niggas turn",
          "rhyme": "9Rn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Witness, real mens mind their own business",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "That’s the difference between sissy-pissy rappers that’s",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Double Dutch, how come I hold the microphone double-clutch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
